      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> RHOAI provides tools such as :\n\n        ° Stable working environments :\n            - Workbenches\n\n        ° Continuous integration and continuous deployment ( CI / CD ) pipelines\n\n     and\n\n        ° Model Serving frameworks\n\n\n--> With these tools, users can create ML workflows :\n\n        ° to train\n\n        up to\n\n        ° to deploy ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> RHOAI provides tools such as :\n\n        ° Stable working environments :\n            - Workbenches\n\n        ° Continuous integration and continuous deployment ( CI / CD ) pipelines\n\n     and\n\n        ° Model Serving frameworks\n\n\n--> With these tools, users can create ML workflows :\n\n        ° to train\n\n        up to\n\n        ° to deploy ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
