      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> OpenShift has established itself as an application platform with the \n    necessary DevOps tooling to run applications\n\n--> The terminology instead of DevOps, what we would use, in this case would be MLOps and AIOps",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> OpenShift has established itself as an application platform with the \n    necessary DevOps tooling to run applications\n\n--> The terminology instead of DevOps, what we would use, in this case would be MLOps and AIOps",
