      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> On top of that, we have other technologies that are powering \n   this end to end experience\n\n        ° So, things like : \n\n            * Nvidia GPU Operator are available\n\n            * CodeFlare Operator \n\n            * ...\n\n        can all be used to create this end to end AI experience\n        on top of OpenShift",
